<title>PORTUGAL: BANK OF PORTUGAL INJECTS 30 BLN ESC, 5.7167 PCT.</title>
<headline>BANK OF PORTUGAL INJECTS 30 BLN ESC, 5.7167 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Portugal said it injected 30 billion escudos of six-day funds into the money market at a weighted average rate of 5.7167 percent in a variable rate repurchase tender.</p>
<p>The rate compared with 5.73 percent on Tuesday.</p>
<p>It offered 30 billion escudos in today's repo.</p>
<p>-- LISBON BUREAU 3511-3538254</p>
</text>
